# Testing

## Current state

Vitest is configured (`npm test` / `vitest run`). Prefer RTK for command output.

## When adding tests (only if user requests)

- Colocate with feature: `*.test.ts` / `*.test.tsx` next to source
- Prioritize: points/thưởng logic, classroom switch persistence, import/export
- Do not introduce a second test stack silently

## Validation

Before finishing UI or data changes:

- `rtk vitest run` — targeted tests first
- `rtk next build` — only when the change can break the production build
- Manual check: sidebar, nav highlight, active classroom survives page change

## TDD

Do not require TDD or 80% coverage unless the user explicitly asks.
